# Hostile: chunks whose sizes take the body past the server's limit, here
# 16 bytes: it fails at the size line that passes it, before that chunk's
# data is read (http.md, 5.3). Drafted by the reference reader, then checked
# by hand.
limits body 16
request POST /upload HTTP/1.1
header Host "localhost:8080"
header Transfer-Encoding "chunked"
framing chunked
body "0123456789"
failed body-too-long
